        These settings are stored securely. OIDC sign-in will become available
        after the shared authentication integration is connected.
      </Callout>
      <Link
        className="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center underline"
        href="/admin/backups"
      >
        Backups posture
      </Link>
      {providers.map((p) => (
